# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
.cargo/*
!.cargo/audit.toml

# Cargo lock files: track the workspace-root Cargo.lock (CI's setup:rust runs
# `cargo fetch --locked` and `Dockerfile` copies it), but ignore lock files
# inside the workspace-excluded sub-projects, which each have their own
# independent dep tree.
#
# EXCEPTION: deposit-prover/Cargo.lock IS tracked. The deposit circuit's
# verifying key (and the VkBlob embedded in the on-chain USDCBridge) is a
# deterministic function of the full dependency closure, so the lock must be
# pinned for the VK to be reproducible. An untracked lock here is exactly what
# made the original on-chain VK (147efe14…) unbuildable after transitive drift.
poseidon-proof/Cargo.lock
crates/bridge-snark-utils/Cargo.lock
crates/bridge-relayer-daemon/Cargo.lock

# Foundry / Solidity
contracts/ethereum/out/
contracts/ethereum/cache/
contracts/ethereum/broadcast/
contracts/ethereum/lib/

# Environment variables and secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env.*.local
.env.sepolia
.secrets

# Personal editor backups of shellnet env files
# (.env.shellnet.<name>.bak, .env.shellnet.*.bak.*) are ignored. The tracked
# shellnet config is a development fixture; production secrets stay external.
.env.shellnet.*.bak
.env.shellnet.*.bak.*

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log

# Bridge prover orchestrator generated artifacts (Phase 1.A+):
# - SRS, VKs, PKs, and per-circuit base-circuit configs are produced by
#   `cargo test` runs. PKs are multi-GB. Do not commit.
crates/bridge-snark-utils/params/*.srs
crates/bridge-snark-utils/params/*_pk.bin
crates/bridge-snark-utils/params/*_vk.bin
crates/bridge-snark-utils/params/*_config_params.json
crates/bridge-snark-utils/target/

# Phase 3: per-circuit proof artefacts (regenerated on demand by
# `cargo run --bin export-fallback-proof`).
crates/bridge-snark-utils/proofs/

# Phase 3: per-circuit gnark-wrapper outputs. Only the .go / go.mod / go.sum
# source code is checked in; the trusted-setup keys, R1CS, and built binaries
# are regenerated locally by `gnark-wrappers/circuit-1b/circuit-1b setup`.
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit-1a
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit-1b
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit-2
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit-3
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit-4
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/proving.key
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/verification.key
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/circuit.r1cs
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/Groth16Verifier.sol
contracts/ethereum/test/fixtures/r15_spike/MultiplierSpikeVerifier.sol
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/groth16_proof.hex
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/groth16_public_inputs.hex
crates/bridge-snark-utils/gnark-wrappers/*/groth16_output.json
logs/

